<PageTitle>Bootstrap Status</PageTitle>

<h1>Surprise Calendar Bootstrap</h1>

<p>This slice bootstraps the application host, Docker Compose setup, PostgreSQL connectivity, and readiness endpoints.</p>

<ul>
    <li>Application host: ASP.NET Core Blazor Web App</li>
    <li>Primary local run path: <code>docker compose up --build</code></li>
    <li>Readiness endpoint: <code>/health/ready</code></li>
    <li>Live endpoint: <code>/health/live</code></li>
    <li>Bootstrap summary endpoint: <code>/api/bootstrap/default-game</code></li>
</ul>

<p>The scratch flow is intentionally not implemented in this issue, but the PostgreSQL schema and deterministic prize initialization are.</p>
